      "content": "I've already looked through his past projects and everything is super polished and well-structured. It's almost *too* clean, you know? It doesn't show me that \"scrappy\" energy we need when things go sideways. If I move him to the next round and he's too slow to react during our pressure tests, it's going to waste the VPs' time. Are you sure he's not just a \"slow and steady\" guy who's going to get overwhelmed here?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
